#api call for creating user account
###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/accounts/user/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username":"tom",
    "email":"tom@gmail.com",
    "password":"tom123",
    "phone":"9876543211"

}

#api call for creating jwt token pair
###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/accounts/jwt/token/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username":"tom",
    "password":"tom123"
}

#api call for creating refresh token
###
